# 7. User Personas

## Persona 1: Security Engineer

Pain Points:

* Too many manual scans
* No centralized visibility

Goals:

* Automated security assessment

## Persona 2: DevOps Engineer

Pain Points:

* Security checks slow deployments

Goals:

* Automated pipeline security

## Persona 3: Developer

Pain Points:

* Unclear vulnerability ownership

Goals:

* Actionable remediation guidance

---

# 8. User Stories

### Authentication

US-001

As a user, I want secure login functionality so that I can access the platform safely.

### Image Registration

US-002

As a DevOps Engineer, I want to register container images so that they can be scanned.

### Vulnerability Scanning

US-003

As a Security Analyst, I want vulnerabilities identified automatically.

### SBOM Generation

US-004

As a Security Analyst, I want software inventories generated automatically.

### Dashboard

US-005

As a user, I want a dashboard showing security posture.

### Compliance Reporting

US-006

As a Compliance Officer, I want downloadable reports.

---

# 9. Functional Requirements

## Authentication Module

FR-001

Description:
User login using JWT authentication.

Priority:
P0

Acceptance Criteria:

* Valid login
* Secure token issuance
* Session validation

---

FR-002

Description:
Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)

Priority:
P0

Acceptance Criteria:

* Admin role
* Analyst role
* Viewer role

---

## Image Management Module

FR-003

Description:
Register Docker images

Priority:
P0

Acceptance Criteria:

* Image stored successfully
* Metadata validation

---

FR-004

Description:
Delete image records

Priority:
P1

Acceptance Criteria:

* Soft delete supported

---

## Vulnerability Scanning Module

FR-005

Description:
Initiate vulnerability scan

Priority:
P0

Acceptance Criteria:

* Scan triggered
* Status tracked

---

FR-006

Description:
Display CVE information

Priority:
P0

Acceptance Criteria:

* Severity
* CVSS score
* Description

---

## SBOM Module

FR-007

Description:
Generate CycloneDX SBOM

Priority:
P0

Acceptance Criteria:

* Valid CycloneDX output

---

FR-008

Description:
Generate SPDX SBOM

Priority:
P1

Acceptance Criteria:

* Valid SPDX output

---

## Reporting Module

FR-009

Description:
Generate PDF reports

Priority:
P1

Acceptance Criteria:

